<title>UK: KDB sets 500 million mark four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>KDB sets 500 million mark four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    14.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
